;pylm
; Font styles:
;    0: TDecorate(count=500, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    1: TDecorate(count=8, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=1501, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=143, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ほお, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=2401, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=2153, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\夕焼け.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\なつみ病室夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>"<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>... I'm sorry..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> has fallen asleep. Making sure of that, I sit up.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Maybe they've given me a painkiller shot, because the stomach pain has eased.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I'm drowsy from the sleeping aid, but just for a bit―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">only a tiny bit, it'll be fine.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">I always take </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> out on walks, so I know how to use a wheelchair.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I've even ridden in one a little, for fun.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I move the IV stand onto the room's wheelchair and quietly get in, careful not to make a sound.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I think I'd be fine walking, but with the sleeping aid and being sick, the wheelchair is just in case.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">I take my time opening the door of the room so it doesn't make a noise.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\病院廊下夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">There's no one in the hallway.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Yeah, I know which part of the hospital this is.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> room is fairly close.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">I really do want to apologize to </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> right away.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">No, rather than apologize, I want to see for myself the fact that </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> hasn't woken up.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">I'll see this fact with my own eyes, and starting tomorrow, face </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> again.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">So that I can face </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> without relying on the mask.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">―Okay, this is the room.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\春花病室夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">The room is dark, but thanks to the streetlight leaking in from outside, my eyes should adjust soon.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But I can't stay long.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The nurses would get mad at me, and more than anything, I'd be causing trouble for </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\肉付き\春花横顔髪寝る.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">I quietly roll the wheelchair up to </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Someone may have forgotten to close the window. It seems to be open a crack, and a faint breeze drifts in.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">In a wheelchair, in this condition, closing the window would be hard...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It's only a matter of time before my April sickness starts, so I should leave this room soon.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> hair isn't tied up, and it falls straight down onto her shoulders.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Lying on her back, eyes half open, she's staring blankly at the ceiling.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It's too dark to make out </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> expression, so I can't tell whether she's angry or crying.</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Even though her eyes are half open, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> doesn't react.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Even when I bring my hand close to her face, she doesn't move a muscle.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">When I touch near her eyes, her </STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="ほお">cheek</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> twitches.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> can only move her body by reflex.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">I see... she really was still asleep.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Confirming this fact once more, I let out a big sigh.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I'm relieved that I've been able to face reality and accept it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> can hear voices even without being conscious, she must also know that I'm here.</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE>, you can stay just as you are. Just listen to me. 
{PAUSE ""}
I guess I really was pushing myself too hard. 
{PAUSE ""}
You still haven't woken up, and I went on without even noticing, and got a stomach ulcer... 
{PAUSE ""}
My heart and body were both a wreck. 
{PAUSE ""}
Me, who can't even look after myself, taking care of you, <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE>... it's absurd, isn't it..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">""</STYLE><PG>
"And also... 
{PAUSE ""}
I'm sorry. You're angry right now, aren't you, <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE>? 
{PAUSE ""}
You're angry that I snuck in to see you like this too, aren't you..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">""</STYLE><PG>
"I'll go back to my own room soon. 
{PAUSE ""}
But I wanted to apologize to you properly, <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE>, I wanted to let you know soon that I can properly accept how things are with you. 
{PAUSE ""}
I don't want to worry you any more, <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">""</STYLE><PG>
"From now on, I'll make sure I'm not a burden on you, <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Goto's</STYLE> life seems to have settled down too, so it looks like she'll help out, and I think I'll have more time to myself than before."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">""</STYLE><PG>
"That's okay, right? Like that..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">""</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\手を握る.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> hand―I take hold of it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> hand hasn't been in mine for a long time.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Before, I used to hold her hand like this now and then, trying to give </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> even a little stimulation.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> hand, just as it was back then, changes shape however my grip moves it.</STYLE><PG>
"Mm... I really am sleepy... 
{PAUSE ""}
I need to get back to my room and sleep soon..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Bye, <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE>. I'm in the hospital for a while, so I'll come again tomorrow."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">............"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "500" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Just then, the faint breeze picks up a little.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\鼓動1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\手を握る反転.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "111" "$0000FF" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "14" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n11\r\n50\r\n200\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "200" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n11\r\n50\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">My subconscious, through danger sense, is screaming from the deep, deep bottom of my mind.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">This situation... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">is dangerous...!</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\bakibaki.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "000" "QUAKE" "1" "3" "3" "0" "10"}
"............!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{QUAKESTOP "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> grips my hand tightly.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">is holding my hand...?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">No way... This must be my delusion too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I'm just mistaking it for her holding my hand.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But for a mistake... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">the sensation is awfully clear.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">More than my danger sense, I'm distracted by the pressure on my hand.</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE>... are you awake...? 
{PAUSE ""}
　Is this my delusion, too...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I rub my eyes once with my free hand, but my other hand is still held by </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Normally this would be something to be happy about, but I can't help wondering if my delusion is still going on.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">This time I try to forcibly shake off </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> hand, but―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\bakibaki.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "000" "QUAKE" "1" "3" "3" "0" "10"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">―But no matter how hard I shake it, her hand won't let go.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">This... isn't a mistake!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{QUAKESTOP "0"}
"<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE>! Are you awake!? Hey!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Do you want to say something? I'm right here, okay?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\なつみ春花顔近い1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\なつみ春花顔近い2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">I lean out of the wheelchair and bring my ear close to </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> mouth.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> heartbeat reaches me as I lean in close, almost lying on top of her.</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\タイトル鼓動.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">―It's a fast heartbeat, different from before.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is clearly reacting. I'm sure it isn't a delusion.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> hand grips even harder, holding me back as if she'll never let me go.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> eyelids twitch, and her head trembles as she tries to open her half-closed eyes all the way.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Her breathing speeds up too, and mixed in with the sound of it, faintly, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> voice begins to come.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPS>"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Na..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>"What is it? I can hear you."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPS>"tsu..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPN>Now </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> reaches her arms toward me and starts drawing her body close.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is moving her body.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">She really did wake up...!</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPS>"mi..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>"What is it? I'm right here."<PG>
{STOPSND "SE2" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">After quick breaths, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> draws in a long, deep breath.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is trying to say something.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">A deep breath, to speak.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Not wanting to miss her voice, I put my ear to </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> mouth.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------